= ecbench report: ECBS1hec2206c6baf4

*Label:* index calculus (prime-abscissa 32, MITM) against rho over 16..26-bit prime-order curves

*Description:* Method × size scaling study (prime curves, bits of p 16,18,20,22,24,26; 2 independent single-target workload(s) per curve, 3 interleaved round(s)). One curve per size so \`ecbench bound fit\` and \`ecbench report\` can fit cost against r. Counted group operations; a measurement, not a performance claim.

Generated by `ecbench report` (ecbench.report\/v1). Observations only; derived numbers carry the key of their derivation (last section).

